title: "Forecast 2040: pre-registered rolling-origin protocol for German passenger car registrations and long-horizon automotive demand"
abstract: >-
  Code, data and results for a pre-registered rolling-origin forecast comparison of
  thirteen models on German passenger car registrations, with the information split
  checked in Lean 4 and a projection to 2040.
